WEBVTT


00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.800
Did you know if you dump 2 pints of tomatoes into a pot,

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.400
then add one quartered shallot,

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.200
3 cloves of garlic, some salt,

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.920
olive oil, more olive oil. Give it a mix

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:22.380
and add 1 block of feta. Drizzle some olive oil,

00:00:22.381 --> 00:00:26.241
sprinkle some thyme and bake for 40 minutes.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.320
Take it out of the oven, add some cooked pasta,

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:36.520
stir it up.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.400
A little bit of lime

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.400
worked.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:47.760
Then you've just made an insanely delicious one pot pasta
